---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { u } from "../lib/u";
---
<Layout title="How our reviews work — CourseDepth" description="How CourseDepth writes course reviews from public ratings, curriculum and update history, and how to suggest a correction." robots="noindex, follow">
<Header />
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>How our reviews work</h1><p>CourseDepth does not collect user-submitted reviews yet. Every course page is written by our editorial team from the provider's public ratings, curriculum and update history.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
<div class="review">
<h2 style="margin-top:0">Why no public review form?</h2>
<p>We removed the review form because the site is static and we could not store submissions reliably. Instead of showing reviews we cannot verify, we only publish what we can check: the provider's aggregate rating, the curriculum, the last update date and our own analysis.</p>
<h2>Spotted something wrong?</h2>
<p>Send the course link and the correction through the <a href={u("/contact")}>contact page</a>. We re-check it against the provider and update the page.</p>
<p><a class="btn-dark" href={u("/courses")}>Browse courses</a></p>
</div>
</div></section>
<Footer />
</Layout>
